Smart Medicine Reminder & Prescription Management System

📌 Project Overview

The Smart Medicine Reminder & Prescription Management System is a full-stack web application designed to help users manage their medicines, set medication reminders, and maintain prescription records.

The system allows users to register, log in, add medicines, view their medicine lists, manage reminders, upload and manage prescriptions, and maintain their profile.

The main aim of this project is to improve medication management and help users follow their prescribed medication schedules on time.

🎯 Objectives

* To help users manage their daily medicines.
* To provide timely medicine reminders.
* To maintain prescription records digitally.
* To reduce the chances of missing medication schedules.
* To provide a simple and user-friendly interface.
* To securely manage user information.

✨ Features

* User Registration: Create a new user account.
* User Login: Securely access the application.
* Dashboard: View medicine management information.
* Add Medicine: Add medicine name, dosage, and schedule.
* My Medicines: View and manage added medicines.
* Reminders: Manage medicine reminder schedules.
* Prescriptions: Maintain prescription records.
* My Profile: View and manage user profile details.
* Logout: Securely log out of the application.

