⚙️ Installation and Execution

1. Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/rihana15172004/SmartMedicineSystem.git

2. Open the Project Folder

cd SmartMedicineSystem

3. Start the Backend

cd backend
npm install
node index.js

The backend server runs at:

http://localhost:5000

4. Start the Frontend

Open another terminal:

cd frontend
npm install
npm start

If the project uses Vite, run:

npm run dev

Open the frontend URL displayed in the terminal.

5. Database Configuration

Make sure MongoDB is running and configure the database connection in the backend environment settings.

Example MongoDB connection:

mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/smartMedicineDB

🔄 Working Process

1. Users register and log in to the application.
2. Users access the dashboard.
3. Users add their medicine details.
4. Added medicines are displayed in the My Medicines section.
5. Users manage their medicine reminders.
6. Users maintain their prescription records.
7. Users can view and update their profile information.

